}],"latest_revision":5,"revision":5,"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2008-04-29T15:03:11.581851"},"last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2026-01-24T08:44:23.385810"}}},"ISBN:9788479019624":{"bib_key":"ISBN:9788479019624","info_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL26270697M/Yoga_para_estar_en_forma","preview":"borrow","preview_url":"https://archive.org/details/isbn_9788479019624","thumbnail_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/9154973-S.jpg","details":{"translated_from":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"number_of_pages":221,"subtitle":"cómo conseguir el cuerpo ideal, alcanzar la liberación interior y transformar tu vida a través del yoga","contributors":[{"role":"Translator","name":"Jordi Joan Serra"},{"role":"Cover Design","name":"Jordi Salvani"},{"role":"Photographer","name":"Richard Corman"}],"covers":[9154973,7939545],"lc_classifications":["RA781.7 .B36518 2003"],"ocaid":"isbn_9788479019624","edition_name":"1st ed.","source_records":["ia:isbn_9788479019624","amazon:847901962X"],"title":"Yoga para estar en forma","work_titles":["Journey into power"],"translation_of":"Journey into Power","languages":[{"key":"/languages/spa"}],"subjects":["Yoga","Popular works","Escritos populares"],"publish_country":"sp ","by_statement":"Baron Baptiste ; [traducción Jordi Joan Serra]","oclc_numbers":["53464205"],"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"physical_dimensions":"27 x  x  centimeters","publishers":["RBA"],"description":"Tanto si eres un atleta que quiere conseguir mejores marcas, un ejecutivo que quiere ser más brillante o un buscador que desea encontrarse a sí mismo, este libro puede ayudarte a alcanzar tus objetivos. Baron Baptiste, uno de los más revolucionarios y dinámicos maestros de yoga del mundo, presenta aquí su programa para el cuerpo, la mente y el espíritu, que ha entusiasmado a numerosas celebridades (como Helen Hunt, Elisabeth Shue o Raquel Welch) y deportisas (ha trabajado como preparador físico para los Philadelphia Eagles durante cuatro años).\r\n\r\nYoga para estar en forma explica que la clave está en descubir al ser perfecto que todos llevamos dentro. Baron Baptiste ha desarrollado un programa completo que cualquier persona puede realizar en casa para superar el estrés, mejorar su aspecto físico y equilibrar su estado emocional. Ilustrado con fotografías descriptivas; este programa en cinco fases también se centra en otros aspectos, como el ejercicio mental, la dieta, la emditación o los hábitos de la vida cotidina.","physical_format":"Print book","key":"/books/OL26270697M","authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL2814911A","name":"Baron Baptiste"}],"publish_places":["Barcelona, Spain"],"pagination":"221 pages :","classifications":{},"dewey_decimal_class":["613.7/046"],"notes":"\"A Fireside book.\"","identifiers":{},"isbn_13":["9788479019624"],"isbn_10":["847901962X"],"publish_date":"2003","works":[{"key":"/works/OL8443153W"}],"latest_revision":6,"revision":6,"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2017-04-30T23:01:22.142591"},"last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2022-12-03T21:36:28.346381"}}},"ISBN:9780007133284":{"bib_key":"ISBN:9780007133284","info_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL20094114M/Journey_into_power","preview":"noview","preview_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL20094114M/Journey_into_power","details":{"publishers":["Thorsons"],"identifiers":{"librarything":["98745"]},"subtitle":"how to sculpt your ideal body, free your true self, and transform your life with yoga","isbn_10":["0007133286"],"key":"/books/OL20094114M","authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL2814911A","name":"Baron Baptiste"}],"publish_places":["London"],"pagination":"217 p. ;","title":"Journey into power","dewey_decimal_class":["613.7046"],"number_of_pages":217,"languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"subjects":["Yoga, Haṭha.","Mind and body.","Self-actualization (Psychology)"],"publish_date":"2002","publish_country":"enk","by_statement":"Baron Baptiste ; photographs by Richard Corman.","works":[{"key":"/works/OL8443153W